AB  - Gemma is a series of source-available large language models developed by Google DeepMind. It is based on similar technologies as Gemini. The first version was released in February 2024, followed by Gemma 2 in June 2024, Gemma 3 in March 2025, and the open-weights Gemma 4 in April 2026. Variants of Gemma have also been developed, such as the vision-language model PaliGemma and the model MedGemma for medical consultation topics.
